# Upload only what the site serves: the holding page, and the game with the engine and text it
# imports. Everything else (vendor's docs and sheet, runner/, verify/, tests, reports) stays off
# the site, so a path like /vendor/dry-run-engine/SIMULATION-MATHS.md is a 404.
/*
!/index.html
!/vercel.json
!/vendor
/vendor/*
!/vendor/dry-run-engine
/vendor/dry-run-engine/*
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/game
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/engine
!/vendor/dry-run-engine/text
